xample  temperature checks before you enter the  dining hall  covid 19 is complicating the return to  classes right across canada  this is our health center but while most  schools worry about school hours  a boarding school has to worry about  every hour day  and night mike armstrong global news  stanstead quebec  and that is global national for this  friday i'm robin gill  tonight your canada is new brunswick  pedicodiac river  also known as the chocolate river you  can see why  thank you for watching jeff semple will  be here over the weekend and i'll see  you again on monday  have a great weekend
 

